  "details": "People have made many different versions of an avatar,  customizing textures, shaders and sometimes adding objects. But the changes typically don't change the base avatar mesh or dynamic bone setup\nsince physbones broke several avatars that would mean those creators may have to fix tens or hundreds of avatars each, one by one.\nWould it be feasible to team up with with the creators of the original avatar and apply a fix to those avatars?\nLike making the automatic dynamic bone conversion aware of common faults and adding workarounds.",
